menu "TesserKIT"

config TESSERKIT_MDNS
    bool "mDNS (<hostname>.local)"
    default y
    help
        Network answers <hostname>.local and advertises its HTTP service, on
        ESP-IDF's mdns component (about 34 KB of flash). Off: the same as
        building with -DTESSERKIT_NO_MDNS.

config TESSERKIT_HOME_ASSISTANT
    bool "Home Assistant discovery (Mqtt)"
    default y
    help
        Mqtt announces the published values and actions to Home Assistant's
        MQTT discovery, when its homeAssistant setting is on (about 10 KB of
        flash with Mqtt). Off: the same as building with
        -DTESSERKIT_NO_HOME_ASSISTANT; the settings aren't in the tree.

endmenu
